---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 5, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy · Viva Wellness Co."
  description="How Viva Wellness Co. collects, uses, and protects your information. Plain-language privacy practices for our concierge telehealth website."
>

  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="container legal-hero__inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">Privacy</span>
      <h1 class="legal-hero__title">
        Your data, <span class="italic-display">your control.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Plain language. No dark patterns. Here is exactly what we collect, why,
        and how to opt out at any time.
      </p>
      <p class="legal-hero__updated">Last updated · {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-body">
    <div class="container legal-body__inner">

      <div class="legal-callout">
        <strong>The short version.</strong>
        The care-path guide runs in your browser and does not send its answers
        to Viva. The contact form sends the details you enter so we can answer
        your non-clinical request. Educational email is optional and requires
        a separate opt-in. We do not sell personal information.
      </div>

      <h2 class="legal-h">What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        From the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>, we collect the name,
        email address, optional phone number, non-clinical topic, and marketing
        preference you submit. The form does not include an open message field.
        Please do not send symptoms, diagnoses, lab results, medication details,
        or other clinical information through this website or ordinary email.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our hosting and security providers process ordinary request information,
        such as IP address, browser and device data, requested URL, timestamps,
        and security signals. If a campaign link contains limited UTM source,
        medium, campaign, or content tags, the contact form may send those tags
        with your request. We do not send search-term tags or care-path answers.
      </p>
      <p>
        The anonymous care-path guide stores its current progress only in the
        page while you use it. Its answers are not added to a URL, browser
        storage, analytics event, contact submission, or email.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use contact details to respond to the topic you select, protect the
        form from abuse, and maintain the operational record of that exchange.
        If you affirmatively select the optional email checkbox, we also send
        occasional practice updates and new educational articles. You can
        withdraw that permission at any time.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Service providers we use</h2>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>
          <strong>Resend</strong> · sends contact confirmations and, for people
          who opt in, educational email. Your name and email address pass through
          its systems. Delivery events such as sent, delivered, bounced,
          complained, opened, or clicked may be reported to Viva.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Cloudflare</strong> · hosts and protects this website and
          provides the Turnstile anti-bot check on public forms. It processes
          the request and security data needed to provide those services.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>GlossGenius</strong> · handles appointment booking and
          payments when you book a visit. They have their own privacy policy
          and we never see your full card details.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Plausible Analytics, if enabled</strong> · measures aggregate
          page views and outbound-link use without cookies. Form fields and
          care-path answers are not sent to Plausible. Its processing is
          described in Plausible's own data policy.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="legal-h">A note on health information (HIPAA)</h2>
      <p>
        This public website is not the practice's channel for protected health
        information (PHI). The care-path guide is anonymous, and the contact
        form is limited to non-clinical topics. Do not share medical details,
        lab results, symptoms, diagnoses, or medication information through a
        site form or regular email.
      </p>
      <p>
        Once you become a patient, all clinical communication moves into our
        HIPAA-compliant patient portal (Charm Health). Lab orders, medication
        shipments, dose adjustments, and provider messaging happen there,
        never through this website or generic email. You receive our full
        <a href="/notice/">Notice of Privacy Practices</a> during intake, which
        describes how PHI may be used and disclosed, and your rights as a
        patient.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you need to discuss clinical care, use the patient portal or call the
        practice for instructions. Do not rely on this website for urgent or
        emergency communication; call 911 for an emergency.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        Viva does not add advertising pixels or session-replay tools to this
        site. Plausible may be enabled for cookieless aggregate measurement.
        Cloudflare, Turnstile, GlossGenius, and other third-party services may
        use storage or process device data under their own policies when you
        use those services. Review the booking provider's policy before entering
        information there.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        Contact requests may remain in the practice mailbox and its email
        provider for operational, security, and legal needs. Limited delivery
        event logs are configured with a 90-day expiration. Unsubscribe and
        suppression records may be kept longer so Viva can honor your choice.
        Clinical records have separate retention requirements and live in the
        patient system, not the marketing form or care-path guide.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Subject to applicable law and appropriate identity verification, you may
        ask Viva to:
      </p>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>Ask what we have about you</li>
        <li>Correct it</li>
        <li>Delete it</li>
        <li>Provide a copy in a usable format where required</li>
        <li>Opt out of all marketing email</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        For PHI held in your patient record, you have the rights described in
        our <a href="/notice/">Notice of Privacy Practices</a>, including the
        right to access, amend, and request an accounting of disclosures of
        your PHI. Email
        <a href="mailto:info&#64;vivawellnessco.com">info&#64;vivawellnessco.com</a>
        to exercise any of these rights.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">State privacy requests</h2>
      <p>
        Privacy rights and exceptions vary by state, the type of information,
        and whether a law applies to a particular organization. Residents of
        Texas, Colorado, Florida, Iowa, or another jurisdiction may send a
        request using the contact information below. Viva will verify and
        respond to requests as required by applicable law. Rights concerning
        patient records are described separately in the
        <a href="/notice/">Notice of Privacy Practices</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Breach notification</h2>
      <p>
        Viva evaluates suspected incidents and provides notices to affected
        people or regulators when required by applicable law. Different rules
        may apply to website contact data and protected patient information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Email opt-out</h2>
      <p>
        Every marketing follow-up email includes unsubscribe instructions. You can
        also use our <a href="/unsubscribe/">email-preferences page</a>, reply
        “stop” to a marketing email, or email
        <a href="mailto:info&#64;vivawellnessco.com">info&#64;vivawellnessco.com</a>.
        We cancel scheduled marketing follow-ups when your request is received.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Children</h2>
      <p>
        Our services are for adults eighteen and older. We do not knowingly
        collect information from anyone under eighteen. If you believe a
        minor has submitted information through this site, email us and we
        will delete it promptly.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Updates</h2>
      <p>
        If we change how we handle information, we will update this page and
        revise the date at the top. We may provide additional notice when a
        change materially affects information already collected.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Questions or complaints</h2>
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:info&#64;vivawellnessco.com">info&#64;vivawellnessco.com</a>
        or call <a href="tel:+17372107283">(737) 210-7283</a>. For HIPAA
        complaints, you may also contact the U.S. Department of Health and
        Human Services, Office for Civil Rights, at
        <a href="https://www.hhs.gov/ocr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">hhs.gov/ocr</a>.
        You will not be retaliated against for filing a complaint.
      </p>

      <p class="legal-foot">
        Viva Wellness Co. · 5900 Balcones Dr #19640, Austin, TX 78731
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    padding: clamp(5rem, 11vw, 9rem) 0 clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .legal-hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: none; /* bronze glow removed in p2 */
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .legal-hero__inner { position: relative; max-width: 70ch; }
  .legal-hero__title {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6.5vw, 5rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .legal-hero__updated {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mute);
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    padding-top: 1.2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .legal-body { padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem) 0 clamp(5rem, 10vw, 8rem); }
  .legal-body__inner { max-width: 70ch; margin: 0 auto; }

  .legal-callout {
    background: var(--ink-2);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--bronze);
    padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(28, 35, 27, 0.9);
  }
  .legal-callout strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--bronze);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .legal-h {
    font-family: var(--font-display-italic);
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.6vw, 1.9rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin: 2.8rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--paper);
  }
  .legal-body p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(28, 35, 27, 0.85);
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
    max-width: none;
  }
  .legal-body a {
    color: var(--bronze);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--butter-deep);
    transition: color 200ms var(--ease), border-color 200ms var(--ease);
  }
  .legal-body a:hover {
    color: var(--bronze-bright);
    border-color: var(--bronze-bright);
  }
  .legal-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .legal-list li {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    position: relative;
    color: rgba(28, 35, 27, 0.85);
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .legal-list li::before {
    content: '·';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--bronze);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .legal-list strong { color: var(--paper); }

  .legal-foot {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--mute);
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .legal-hero { padding: 3.75rem 0 2.25rem; }
    .legal-hero__title { font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 10.5vw, 2.8rem); margin: 0.75rem 0 1.15rem; }
    .legal-body { padding: 1.75rem 0 4rem; }
    .legal-callout { padding: 1.25rem; }
  }
</style>
